1
00:01:39,359 --> 00:01:41,519
Isn't this the infamous traitor

2
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:44,439
from Yibei, Gu Chenyang?

3
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:45,920
What now?

4
00:01:46,439 --> 00:01:47,599
Want to hit someone again?

5
00:01:50,359 --> 00:01:51,519
Feeling angry?

6
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:52,799
Come on,

7
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:54,120
hit me.

8
00:01:57,519 --> 00:01:59,640
After that, you'll be trending again.

9
00:02:00,319 --> 00:02:02,319
Then, you, the golden boy,

10
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:04,200
will completely turn into

11
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:06,040
a mouse scurrying through the streets.

12
00:02:07,799 --> 00:02:09,400
Why do you frame us?

13
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:11,319
Because I got you disciplined

14
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:12,879
in the last fight,

15
00:02:12,879 --> 00:02:13,639
right?

16
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:15,800
Don't talk nonsense.

17
00:02:16,479 --> 00:02:18,280
I just passed the ball

18
00:02:18,599 --> 00:02:19,759
and accidentally touched

19
00:02:19,759 --> 00:02:20,800
your player.

20
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:22,439
You guys just jumped

21
00:02:22,439 --> 00:02:23,400
on me.

22
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:24,680
And in the end,

23
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:26,719
I got punished,

24
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:28,919
and you guys got away with it.

25
00:02:29,199 --> 00:02:30,280
You're twisting the truth.

26
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:31,680
What do you want?

27
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:33,840
I don't want anything.

28
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:35,080
I just want you

29
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:36,719
to go back to where you came from.

30
00:02:37,159 --> 00:02:38,639
Stop getting in my way.

31
00:02:39,879 --> 00:02:40,879
Aren't you afraid

32
00:02:41,199 --> 00:02:43,039
I'll expose you online?

33
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:44,520
I'll just

34
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:45,960
do the same to you.

35
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:49,240
I'm so scared.

36
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:51,039
Don't forget,

37
00:02:51,199 --> 00:02:52,159
you are now

38
00:02:52,159 --> 00:02:52,639
the basketball team

39
00:02:52,639 --> 00:02:54,599
that everyone hates online.

40
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:55,719
And I'm just

41
00:02:56,599 --> 00:02:58,080
an ordinary person.

42
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:01,319
You want to bully me?

43
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,479
You really think you're not

44
00:03:05,479 --> 00:03:06,639
popular enough?

45
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:09,840
Anyway,

46
00:03:09,919 --> 00:03:11,560
I'll report you to your school.

47
00:03:11,599 --> 00:03:12,560
Whatever.

48
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:14,800
I'm a starter on the team

49
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:16,479
and we're going to the provincial league.

50
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:17,400
Think about it,

51
00:03:18,319 --> 00:03:19,759
will the school help me

52
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:21,960
or you?

53
00:03:41,599 --> 00:03:42,199
Bro,

54
00:03:42,199 --> 00:03:43,560
I heard the person who spread rumors about the basketball club

55
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:44,439
apologized.

56
00:03:44,439 --> 00:03:45,960
Are the brothers okay?

57
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:46,879
Not very well.

58
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:48,240
This matter

59
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:49,240
has a great impact.

60
00:03:49,719 --> 00:03:50,639
Their school

61
00:03:50,639 --> 00:03:51,919
should disband the team

62
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:53,599
and withdraw from the following competitions.

63
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:56,400
That's too bad for them.

64
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:57,719
There's no way.

65
00:03:58,560 --> 00:04:00,039
People online are all cursing them.

66
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:02,039
Withdrawing from the competition

67
00:04:02,479 --> 00:04:02,919
is also to

68
00:04:02,919 --> 00:04:04,240
better protect them.

69
00:04:04,319 --> 00:04:06,199
Those messages are clearly fake.

70
00:04:06,199 --> 00:04:07,800
I hate those people online.

71
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:08,599
By the way,

72
00:04:08,599 --> 00:04:09,319
brother,

73
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:11,120
did you get scolded by the team today?

74
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:14,039
Brother is fine.

75
00:04:14,719 --> 00:04:15,520
By the way,

76
00:04:15,719 --> 00:04:16,439
I might

77
00:04:16,439 --> 00:04:17,839
do something big soon.

78
00:04:18,199 --> 00:04:19,360
What's that?

79
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:20,959
I'll tell you when it's done.

80
00:04:21,319 --> 00:04:23,079
It'll be a surprise for you.

81
00:04:23,079 --> 00:04:23,800
Okay.

82
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:47,879
Have you decided?

83
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,720
The online discussion is still going,

84
00:04:53,839 --> 00:04:55,720
even though many are false rumors,

85
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:58,040
they still have a big impact

86
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:01,240
among students and parents.

87
00:05:02,759 --> 00:05:04,839
But it's not your fault.

88
00:05:05,639 --> 00:05:06,879
The school was thinking

89
00:05:06,879 --> 00:05:08,199
of using this incident

90
00:05:08,439 --> 00:05:09,480
to launch a series of

91
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:10,800
campus events

92
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:12,199
about online life,

93
00:05:12,399 --> 00:05:14,680
to guide students to use the Internet healthily

94
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:17,439
and view online events rationally.

95
00:05:19,399 --> 00:05:20,439
Sir, I understand.

96
00:05:21,399 --> 00:05:23,120
But I resigned as the president of the student union

97
00:05:23,279 --> 00:05:23,839
because of

98
00:05:23,839 --> 00:05:25,360
something wrong with the club.

99
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:27,360
It's for the Student Union.

100
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,560
As long as I am the president,

101
00:05:30,639 --> 00:05:31,399
the prestige of the Student Union

102
00:05:31,399 --> 00:05:32,800
will always be questioned.

103
00:05:34,399 --> 00:05:35,079
It's unfair

104
00:05:35,079 --> 00:05:36,560
to other students

105
00:05:36,879 --> 00:05:37,720
who work hard.

106
00:05:39,399 --> 00:05:40,199
You

107
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:42,519
always think of others.

108
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:45,399
Alright,

109
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:47,680
I'll discuss it with your teacher

110
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:48,920
and get back to you.

111
00:06:01,839 --> 00:06:02,759
Thank you, sir.

112
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:04,639
Thank you and Ms. Wang

113
00:06:04,639 --> 00:06:06,040
for all your support.

114
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:28,120
What a good kid.

115
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:29,879
You've made me

116
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:31,839
a bit emotional.

117
00:06:38,519 --> 00:06:39,279
Hello everyone,

118
00:06:39,279 --> 00:06:40,519
I'm Lin Qingyuan.

119
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:42,240
I'm going to be a brother soon,

120
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:43,279
so I came to learn

121
00:06:43,279 --> 00:06:44,639
how to make a cake

122
00:06:44,639 --> 00:06:45,639
from Zhou Yang.

123
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:46,399
I'll make one

124
00:06:46,439 --> 00:06:47,920
for my brother or sister.

125
00:06:48,319 --> 00:06:49,600
Doesn't he have a nanny?

126
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:51,160
Why make a cake himself?

127
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:52,519
Who is he trying to impress?

128
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:54,199
He's trying to

129
00:06:54,199 --> 00:06:55,560
be a good brother.

130
00:06:55,879 --> 00:06:57,319
Who is he trying to impress?

131
00:06:58,199 --> 00:06:58,920
I heard his parents

132
00:06:58,920 --> 00:06:59,959
are just idling away their days,

133
00:06:59,959 --> 00:07:00,959
playing around everywhere.

134
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:03,079
And they still want a second child?

135
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:04,720
Can't they take some responsibility?

136
00:07:18,439 --> 00:07:19,240
Brother Lin.

137
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:20,600
Yuan.

138
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:22,759
I've seen all those things online.

139
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:23,839
How are you guys doing?

140
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:24,920
Are you all okay?

141
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:27,160
We're fine.

142
00:07:28,439 --> 00:07:29,360
We've already found

143
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:30,560
the person behind it.

144
00:07:30,639 --> 00:07:31,560
You and Ye

145
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:32,639
don't need to worry anymore.

146
00:07:33,279 --> 00:07:34,079
That's good.

147
00:07:34,519 --> 00:07:36,439
Those people online are just idle.

148
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:37,319
Keyboard warriors.

149
00:07:37,879 --> 00:07:39,240
Don't take it to heart.

150
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:40,040
[I bought you]

151
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:41,360
[something delicious.]

152
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:42,920
[Come back early after school.]

153
00:07:44,439 --> 00:07:45,240
That's great.

154
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:12,199
The seniors

155
00:08:12,199 --> 00:08:13,639
are not like what the netizens said.

156
00:08:14,279 --> 00:08:15,680
They never have any privileges.

157
00:08:16,439 --> 00:08:17,399
The provincial top eight

158
00:08:17,399 --> 00:08:18,399
was won by them

159
00:08:18,399 --> 00:08:19,399
in one competition after another.

160
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:20,839
You can watch the game videos

161
00:08:20,839 --> 00:08:21,759
to know the truth.

162
00:08:23,319 --> 00:08:24,279
The full surveillance footage of the fight

163
00:08:24,279 --> 00:08:25,279
has been released.

164
00:08:25,879 --> 00:08:26,800
The time of transferring schools

165
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:27,839
has also been evidenced.

166
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:30,560
Why doesn't anyone believe it?

167
00:08:37,679 --> 00:08:38,720
Who are you?

168
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:40,720
Why should we listen to you?

169
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,639
What does it have to do with you?

170
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:44,639
Are you related to him?

171
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:48,399
Why

172
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:49,720
is it like this?

173
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:10,000
Xu.

174
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:11,240
Why are you here?

175
00:09:11,759 --> 00:09:12,559
Good for you.

176
00:09:12,799 --> 00:09:14,360
You've made progress in a few days.

177
00:09:14,519 --> 00:09:15,879
It seems that playing basketball

178
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:16,759
doesn't interfere with your study.

179
00:09:19,399 --> 00:09:20,639
You come all the way here

180
00:09:21,039 --> 00:09:22,159
just to praise me?

181
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,000
Sit.

182
00:09:31,159 --> 00:09:31,879
Well,

183
00:09:31,879 --> 00:09:33,279
I'm here to tell you

184
00:09:35,279 --> 00:09:36,080
that our

185
00:09:36,799 --> 00:09:37,440
live show

186
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:38,360
is the one

187
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,080
I told you before

188
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:41,039
and asked you to go.

189
00:09:41,039 --> 00:09:42,200
It's canceled, right?

190
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:46,840
I'm infamous

191
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:48,240
on the Internet now.

192
00:09:57,639 --> 00:09:58,519
Don't be discouraged.

193
00:09:59,159 --> 00:10:00,240
It will get better.

194
00:10:00,559 --> 00:10:01,919
If you can't act, just play basketball.

195
00:10:02,679 --> 00:10:04,080
Aren't there still games coming up?

196
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:05,759
But

197
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:08,120
I might not be able to play either.

198
00:10:10,159 --> 00:10:10,679
Alright.

199
00:10:10,679 --> 00:10:11,559
Don't be so down.

200
00:10:12,799 --> 00:10:14,120
I'll make an exception and let you hear something good.

201
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,320
A new song I wrote.

202
00:10:17,799 --> 00:10:19,080
Even Jiang Yi hasn't heard it.

203
00:10:19,519 --> 00:10:20,320
Really?

204
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:20,919
Really.

205
00:10:26,559 --> 00:10:27,840
I was thinking of writing one

206
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:30,159
for your opening.

207
00:10:32,519 --> 00:10:33,039
Listen.

208
00:11:07,639 --> 00:11:08,519
He's fine.

209
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:09,759
Don't worry.

210
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:28,919
Here.

211
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:29,679
Thanks, Mom.

212
00:11:29,679 --> 00:11:30,440
Eat up.

213
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:33,120
Come on,

214
00:11:33,399 --> 00:11:34,200
eat something.

215
00:11:35,919 --> 00:11:36,399
Dad,

216
00:11:36,919 --> 00:11:37,559
Mom,

217
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:40,159
I'm sorry.

218
00:11:41,279 --> 00:11:42,799
If it weren't for our situation,

219
00:11:42,799 --> 00:11:44,559
the boxing gym wouldn't have been affected.

220
00:11:45,279 --> 00:11:46,840
Not even the students showed up today.

221
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:48,759
What does that have to do with you?

222
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:50,240
Those parents dropped their classes

223
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:52,039
because they saw me fighting in the video,

224
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:53,559
saying it's too violent.

225
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,600
But many people still support me.

226
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:56,759
It's just a coincidence

227
00:11:56,759 --> 00:11:57,720
that no one came today.

228
00:11:57,720 --> 00:11:58,679
You're right.

229
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:00,919
Xu Anbo,

230
00:12:01,639 --> 00:12:02,399
do you know

231
00:12:02,399 --> 00:12:03,840
what's the most important thing in boxing?

232
00:12:06,399 --> 00:12:07,200
Remember,

233
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:08,519
in boxing,

234
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:10,240
everyone gets knocked down.

235
00:12:11,039 --> 00:12:12,759
but it's about getting back up.

236
00:12:13,559 --> 00:12:15,639
If you can't get back up,

237
00:12:15,639 --> 00:12:17,200
that's when you truly lose.

238
00:12:19,360 --> 00:12:20,200
Exactly.

239
00:12:20,799 --> 00:12:21,840
We've got your back

240
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:23,799
on this, no matter what.

241
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:25,320
Gu Chenyang's mom

242
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:26,519
has already reached out to me.

243
00:12:26,879 --> 00:12:27,799
The parents

244
00:12:27,799 --> 00:12:28,679
are organizing a meeting

245
00:12:28,679 --> 00:12:30,120
with the school

246
00:12:30,559 --> 00:12:32,639
to back you up.

247
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:34,919
Thank you, Dad.

248
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:35,960
Thank you, Mom.

249
00:12:36,759 --> 00:12:37,159
Alright,

250
00:12:37,159 --> 00:12:37,919
let's eat.

251
00:12:37,919 --> 00:12:38,440
We need to be full

252
00:12:38,440 --> 00:12:39,679
to have the energy to fight.

253
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:40,799
Right.

254
00:12:40,799 --> 00:12:41,200
Come on.

255
00:12:41,200 --> 00:12:41,840
Eat.

256
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:43,399
Come on.

257
00:12:43,600 --> 00:12:44,399
Eat more.

258
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:54,240
[Fu Bin Yan,]

259
00:12:54,799 --> 00:12:56,360
[I'll take the other students]

260
00:12:56,600 --> 00:12:58,279
[to the violin competition today.]

261
00:12:58,679 --> 00:13:00,039
[It's not that you're not excellent,]

262
00:13:00,440 --> 00:13:02,440
[but I'm afraid the judges]

263
00:13:02,519 --> 00:13:04,000
[might recognize you online]

264
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:05,279
[and affect your score.]

265
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:07,720
[It's a rare opportunity,]

266
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:09,080
[I hope you understand.]

267
00:13:11,480 --> 00:13:12,320
Fu,

268
00:13:12,320 --> 00:13:14,240
you should read less news online recently.

269
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:15,960
It's not good for your heart.

270
00:13:16,200 --> 00:13:17,919
You can't get excited.

271
00:13:18,600 --> 00:13:19,399
Fu Bin Yan.

272
00:13:19,679 --> 00:13:20,320
I heard that the school

273
00:13:20,320 --> 00:13:21,480
may ask us to withdraw from the competition,

274
00:13:21,879 --> 00:13:23,440
and terminate club activities.

275
00:13:24,919 --> 00:13:25,879
High school basketball team

276
00:13:25,879 --> 00:13:27,120
needs a data analyst.

277
00:13:27,519 --> 00:13:28,840
It's ridiculous.

278
00:13:29,279 --> 00:13:31,120
He must be a freeloader in the club.

279
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:34,679
I heard he had heart disease.

280
00:13:35,519 --> 00:13:36,399
His family is so rich.

281
00:13:36,399 --> 00:13:37,919
Why not buy a good heart?

282
00:13:38,600 --> 00:13:39,960
It seems that he is not rich enough.

283
00:14:35,919 --> 00:14:36,600
Isn't this the thermos

284
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:37,799
we bought for you?

285
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:39,480
You are willing to use it.

286
00:14:40,200 --> 00:14:41,159
There are a lot of things recently.

287
00:14:41,480 --> 00:14:42,519
Drink more hot water

288
00:14:42,960 --> 00:14:43,799
to cool down.

289
00:14:48,879 --> 00:14:49,720
Do you think we can keep

290
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:50,799
our basketball club?

291
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:52,039
Yeah.

292
00:14:52,279 --> 00:14:53,320
Even if we don't break up,

293
00:14:53,600 --> 00:14:55,120
without the title of a club,

294
00:14:56,120 --> 00:14:57,559
it feels like something's missing.

295
00:15:00,840 --> 00:15:01,799
We can only wait and see

296
00:15:01,799 --> 00:15:03,759
how the negotiations go this afternoon.

297
00:15:04,919 --> 00:15:05,679
We must believe

298
00:15:05,679 --> 00:15:06,720
in our parents.

